title: 'NRT_LAND: code for "Machine learning emulators of dynamic global vegetation models for fast gridded carbon budget predictions"'
abstract: "Code to train and run the convolutional neural network emulators of the TRENDY dynamic global vegetation models, to prepare their inputs and to produce the figures and tables of the paper."
